# group_project Development Guidelines

Auto-generated from feature plan `001-similarity-search-topk`. Last updated: 2026-04-04

## Active Technologies

- Python **3.12+**, **stdlib only** (no PyPI) — see `.specify/memory/constitution.md`
- Feature: top-k profile similarity search (`specs/001-similarity-search-topk/`)

## Project Structure

```text
group_project/
├── src/
│   ├── main.py              # CLI entry
│   └── services/
│       ├── helper.py        # Pure utils (min-max, bbox, weighted dist to AABB)
│       ├── core/            # exceptions
│       ├── similarity/      # pipeline / profiles
│       ├── search/          # distance, topk, benchmark, strategies/
│       └── io/              # jsonio
└── tests/
```

## Commands

```bash
cd group_project
export PYTHONPATH="${PYTHONPATH}:$(pwd)/src"
python -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_*.py'
python src/main.py --help
```

## Code Style

- PEP 8, strict type hints, Google-style docstrings, custom exception hierarchy
- Tests: `unittest` only (no pytest)

